Dynamic lighting (Private Quarters) Same capability as settlement-wide, plus individual programming. Dawn simulation for wake cycles. Article II (autonomy); Decompression Cycle support
Acoustic environment (communal) Zone-controlled ambient sound system. Four zones minimum: Commons, corridors, greenhouse, Mediation Pod. Each zone independently programmable. Default: natural soundscapes during waking hours, white noise during sleep-cycle hours in corridors. Burnout Protection; Sensory Monotony Mitigation
