Appendix F: Anti-Capture Mechanisms — Ruleset

1. Role Rotation: Facilitation Committee: max 2 consecutive terms, lifetime max 4. Emergency Council pre-assigned settlers: rotate every 6 months. RJ mediators: step down from pool for 1 year after 3 Circles.
2. Cooling-Off Periods: Committee members may not hold Domain Authority during term. Former Emergency Council members ineligible for Committee for 2 years.
3. Lottery Selection: When >3 qualified candidates, final selection by verifiable random lottery.
4. Conflict-of-Interest Registry: Public, continuously updated. Undisclosed COI triggers immediate removal from all roles and 2-year ineligibility.
5. Competence Distribution Mandate: Minimum 3 certified Domain Holders per safety-critical Domain. No sole holder >6 months.

